&h=200&s=e850016ce127d798db7c994970884851 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2078ec4e/uploads/origins/67043f19-993f-4f94-a67b-b734b0b94097?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b6c351e1f7f9f276a98d024d4cbd0cba", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2078ec4e/uploads/origins/67043f19-993f-4f94-a67b-b734b0b94097?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b6c351e1f7f9f276a98d024d4cbd0cba, https://si.imgix.net/2078ec4e/uploads/origins/67043f19-993f-4f94-a67b-b734b0b94097?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c6b021ed6b93ae85d99ec3f21ad0ffb2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2078ec4e/uploads/origins/67043f19-993f-4f94-a67b-b734b0b94097?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dd700b279df30e6cbcb5dc5c838f0bab 3x"}, "body": "Hello Hidari, your artstyle is cute and adorable!\n\nI would like to request a illustration of my OC, her name is Lumen. She is a mage who is proficient in elemental and light magic. She is tall and tomboyish, she has short black bobbed hair that curls at the ends, red eyes, tanned skin, freckles, a mole under her eye, one on under the right corner of her lip, and one on her breast.\n\nI really like your Witcher drawings, they show the magic of that world really well, so I would like something similar. You may edit the outfit as much as you want, please be as creative as you like! Thank you for your time!  Weapon is does not need to be included, references are in the reference URL.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MeP81vitoY7If1VxZ5SlmcRuF5acTaH8?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@HidariMimi/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2630806, "cli