aw my character, Gale! She is the blonde haired girl included in the album. If you want a character description, she is very much a free spirit, who is warmhearted and kind, but also never thinks before she acts.  She is a brawler that uses wind magic to enhance her abilities, so she fights with close combat (the gloves she wears to fight are included on the reference sheet). The wind would be shown through bracelets made of wind around her wrists.\n\nI was wondering if you could draw her in an action pose where she is ready to fight. For her face, I was wondering if you could do a confident smirk on her face. I will leave the background to you. ^^\n\nI hope this isn't too complex! If you feel that this is something you can't do, then I totally understand if you deny this request!\n\nThank you very much! :)\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/2OQmwVl", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@HidariMimi/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2630806, "client_id": 893519, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f29b59ff/uploads/origins/65e43416-1084-45b4-b220-3c3a1a908933?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61140bf00d9b86e3f86d4fa414fab52d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f29b59ff/uploads/origins/65e43416-1084-45b4-b220-3c3a1a908933?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61140bf00d9b86e3f86d4fa414fab52d, https://si.imgix.net/f29b59ff/uploads/origins/65e43416-1084-45b4-b220-3c3a1a908933?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=85bb8bccb2ef5ff34aa893123849861c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f29b59ff/uploads/origins/65e43416-1084-45b4-b220-3c3a1a908933?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59e5abc98a545292143e08d461ce6f94 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": fals